### 1) Give building 1 to the manager     # EXPECT 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/user/d4086cb4-50f4-4baf-9c80-524545048ef0/buildings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2) Same again                          # EXPECT 409 (already in this building)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/user/d4086cb4-50f4-4baf-9c80-524545048ef0/buildings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3) List the manager's buildings        # EXPECT only building 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/user/d4086cb4-50f4-4baf-9c80-524545048ef0/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4) Building that does not exist        # EXPECT 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/user/ebb6eb41-f9e6-440a-9074-c71fe8b1512f/buildings/99
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5) Manager token + header 1            # EXPECT 200 (needs the manager's token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/room/get-all
Authorization: Bearer {{marekToken}}
X-Building-Id: 1

### 6) Manager token + header 2            # EXPECT 403 (not their building)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/room/get-all
Authorization: Bearer {{ff}}
X-Building-Id: 2

### 7) Take the building away              # EXPECT 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/user/<managerId>/buildings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

